cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "MedROAD V3: Multi-Modal FHIR Sensor Fusion for Real-Time Clinical Decision Support"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of MedROAD V3, a real-time closed-loop FHIR R4
  streaming architecture for multi-modal sensor fusion in clinical decision
  support. Integrates OpenEMR, Apache Kafka, and a calibrated XGBoost-LSTM-
  Transformer ensemble with SHAP explainability and LLM-generated bedside
  narratives, with a documented extension path to remote patient monitoring.
type: software
version: 2.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/pboulanger/medroad-v3"
keywords:
  - FHIR
  - sensor fusion
  - telemedicine
  - remote patient monitoring
  - clinical decision support
  - explainable AI
  - stream processing

